 "remarks": "Spacious townhouse-style condo in the convenient Springdale neighborhood! Features include an attached 1-car garage, large living room with fireplace, formal dining room, and eat-in kitchen with white cabinets and black/stainless appliances. Hardwood floors on the main level, freshly painted interior, and new carpeting throughout upper and lower levels. Two large bedrooms upstairs-primary with extra vanity closet, potential for en suite bath. Lower level offers a den, laundry, storage, and sliders to a private deck. NYC commuter's delight! Walk to Springdale Metro-North station, restaurants, and shopping, grocery store, post office, daycare all within a 1 mile radius. Great combination of space, comfort, and location!",
